OL,4,CBus lane to reopen to taxis despite    
OL,5,Ctraffic warning                        
OL,6,GA bus lane is set to be reopened to    
OL,7,Gtaxis despite the council previously   
OL,8,Gsaying that doing so would lead to     
OL,9,Gmore traffic.                          
OL,11,FGateshead Council said the section of  
OL,12,FAskew Road that approached the Tyne    
OL,13,FBridge, which was made bus-only in     
OL,14,F2020, would be reopened to taxis and   
OL,15,Fprivate hire vehicles from early       
OL,16,FDecember.                              
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
