OL,4,CPigeon strung up like puppet in        
OL,5,C'horrific' attack                      
OL,6,GA pigeon has made a full recovery      
OL,7,Gafter it was strung up and turned into 
OL,8,Ga living puppet "like Pinocchio", an   
OL,9,Ganimal rescue charity has said.        
OL,11,FThe bird, which was found abandoned    
OL,12,Fand unable to move by a dog walker in  
OL,13,FJarrow, had its wings bound in tape    
OL,14,Fand was attached to a stick using      
OL,15,Ffishing wire.                          
OL,17,FThe woman, who was alerted to the      
OL,18,Fstranded animal by her dog, brought    
OL,19,Fthe bird to Pawz for Thought in        
OL,20,FSunderland to be cared for.            
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
